        "answer": {
          "short": "$25.13\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}A &= \\pi r^2\\\\16\\pi &= \\pi r^2\\\\r &= 4\\text{ cm}\\\\C &= 2\\pi r\\\\C &= 2\\pi(4)=8\\pi\\text{ cm}\\\\C &\\approx 25.13\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
